{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人江若琳一家三口遊上海，她對上海特別有感情，原因上海是她與老公蕭唯展相遇的地方，她晒出在黃埔江攬實老公的照片，有趣是由兒子拿機，一家三口十分溫馨，她發文：「上海給了我一個『家』，一個對我們倆好重要嘅地方！</p><p>一粒『蕭式生煎包』嘅開始！</p><p>」江若琳</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T01:27:17.573849+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T01:01:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T01:20:25.311103+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T01:20:25.311103+00:00","content_hash":"ad6aecccb06c8b07e67ade790d59e3a723e199f644ed5906e2764621f00644c9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}